  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "d4cbe312-bbf6-4770-bc6f-cf1dc4786e69"],
 " (InfraGeometry)",
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the named undirected substrates"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"89aa2e3d-3e7a-4388-99eb-64cd9dd94a60"]
}, Open  ]],

